OL,3,A'Cruise for life' ship seized in
OL,4,ASingapore
OL,5,
OL,6,FA round-the-world cruise that left
OL,7,Fpassengers stranded in Cambodia after
OL,8,Fits US-based operator ran out of money
OL,9,Fhas been seized in Singapore.
OL,11,FThe Odyssey, which set off from Belfast
OL,12,Fin October 2024 and was meant to take
OL,13,Fguests on a years-long voyage around
OL,14,Fthe world, is now anchored in Singapore
OL,15,Fport waters, local authorities say.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
